{"schema_version":"1.0","issue_id":"SP-2026-M05","package_id":"inference-serving-may","draft_version":"v0.1","status":"DRAFT","headline":"Inference & Serving — 5月、最適化はcache・MoE・kernel・runtimeをまたいだ","deck":"vLLM、SGLang、FlashInferのreleaseが続く一方、研究側ではKV cache再利用やMoE expert reuseが掘り下げられた。モデルの外側にあるserving stackは、単一kernelではなく複数layerの協調問題になっている。","deck_attribution_mode":"MIXED","deck_evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:series-github-series-vllm-project-vllm-14c8073114","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-reviewed-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:series-github-series-sgl-project-sglang-e63ed0bdf0","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-reviewed-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:duplicate-hint-github-series-flashinfer-7f4c25e2bf","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-reviewed-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:item-arxiv-2605-24022v1-46c9a2231e","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-reviewed-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:item-arxiv-2605-27081v1-5ebb44e7f0","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-reviewed-1"}],"blocks":[{"block_id":"opening-heading","block_type":"HEADING","text":"5月の変化を一つのsystemとして読む","attribution_mode":"NONE","evidence_refs":[]},{"block_id":"opening","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"同じモデルでも、どのruntime・attention backend・cache方針・parallelism・kernelで動かすかによって実運用の制約は大きく変わる。5月はvLLM、SGLang、FlashInferがそれぞれ継続的に更新され、研究側でもlong-context KV reuseやmemory-constrained MoE inferenceが別の角度から扱われた。","attribution_mode":"INFERENCE","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:series-github-series-vllm-project-vllm-14c8073114","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-reviewed-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:series-github-series-sgl-project-sglang-e63ed0bdf0","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-reviewed-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:duplicate-hint-github-series-flashinfer-7f4c25e2bf","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-reviewed-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:item-arxiv-2605-24022v1-46c9a2231e","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-reviewed-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:item-arxiv-2605-27081v1-5ebb44e7f0","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-reviewed-1"}]},{"block_id":"item-01-heading","block_type":"HEADING","text":"vllm-project/vllm May 2026 release series","attribution_mode":"NONE","evidence_refs":[]},{"block_id":"item-01","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"vLLMは5月4日のv0.20.1、15日のv0.21.0、29日のv0.22.0と更新を重ねた。release notesではDeepSeek V4 hardening、KV/offload、attention backend、Model Runner V2、speculative/disaggregated servingなどが扱われており、serving engineが複数のmodel familyとruntime techniqueを同時に吸収している。","attribution_mode":"ATTRIBUTED","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:series-github-series-vllm-project-vllm-14c8073114","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-reviewed-1"}]},{"block_id":"item-02-heading","block_type":"HEADING","text":"sgl-project/sglang May 2026 release series","attribution_mode":"NONE","evidence_refs":[]},{"block_id":"item-02","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"SGLangは5月5日のv0.5.11と16日のv0.5.12で、speculative decoding、disaggregated prefix caching、model support、DeepSeek V4 inference pathなどを更新した。個別のthroughput値ではなく、prefix/cacheとmodel-specific executionが同じrelease seriesで進んでいる点に注目したい。","attribution_mode":"ATTRIBUTED","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:series-github-series-sgl-project-sglang-e63ed0bdf0","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-reviewed-1"}]},{"block_id":"item-03-heading","block_type":"HEADING","text":"Release v0.6.12","attribution_mode":"NONE","evidence_refs":[]},{"block_id":"item-03","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"FlashInfer v0.6.12は5月29日に公開され、release notesにはNVFP4 quantization、MoE kernel、GQA/MLA path、model/backend supportが並ぶ。kernel layerでもquantization・attention・MoEが密接に結び付いており、frontier model対応が低level runtimeへ波及している。","attribution_mode":"ATTRIBUTED","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:duplicate-hint-github-series-flashinfer-7f4c25e2bf","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-reviewed-1"}]},{"block_id":"item-04-heading","block_type":"HEADING","text":"Adaptive KV Cache Reuse for Fast Long-Context LLM Serving","attribution_mode":"NONE","evidence_refs":[]},{"block_id":"item-04","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"CacheTuneは、厳密なprefix一致だけに頼らず、attention関係を保つため必要なcontextを適応的に再計算しながらKV cacheを再利用する設計を提案する。これは著者による研究結果であり、一般的なspeedup保証ではないが、long-context servingで「何を再利用できるか」自体を最適化対象にする方向を示す。","attribution_mode":"ATTRIBUTED","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:item-arxiv-2605-24022v1-46c9a2231e","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-reviewed-1"}]},{"block_id":"item-05-heading","block_type":"HEADING","text":"ReMoE: Boosting Expert Reuse through Router Fine-Tuning in Memory-Constrained MoE LLM Inference","attribution_mode":"NONE","evidence_refs":[]},{"block_id":"item-05","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"ReMoEはmemory-constrainedなMoE inferenceでexpert reuseを高めるためrouter fine-tuningを利用する。MoE servingでは計算量だけでなくexpert weightのresident／transfer costが問題になるため、model architectureとruntime memory制約の境界を跨ぐ研究として位置付けられる。","attribution_mode":"ATTRIBUTED","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:item-arxiv-2605-27081v1-5ebb44e7f0","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-reviewed-1"}]},{"block_id":"theme-synthesis-heading","block_type":"HEADING","text":"Theme Synthesis","attribution_mode":"NONE","evidence_refs":[]},{"block_id":"theme-synthesis","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"ここで重要なのは、個々のproject benchmarkを一つの勝敗表へ混ぜないことだ。release noteは実装変更の一次資料だが性能値はproject条件に依存し、論文のspeedupも著者が選んだmodel・hardware・workload・baselineに依存する。5月の意味は、最適化対象がcacheからexpert、kernel、runtimeまでstack全体へ広がった点にある。","attribution_mode":"INFERENCE","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:series-github-series-vllm-project-vllm-14c8073114","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-reviewed-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:series-github-series-sgl-project-sglang-e63ed0bdf0","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-reviewed-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:duplicate-hint-github-series-flashinfer-7f4c25e2bf","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-reviewed-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:item-arxiv-2605-24022v1-46c9a2231e","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-reviewed-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:item-arxiv-2605-27081v1-5ebb44e7f0","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-reviewed-1"}]},{"block_id":"claim-boundary-1","block_type":"CLAIM_BOUNDARY","text":"Claim Boundary: GitHub release notesはrelease chronologyと記載された実装変更を確認する一次資料だが、projectが示すperformanceやcross-hardwareな一般化は本稿で独立再現していない。","attribution_mode":"INFERENCE","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:series-github-series-vllm-project-vllm-14c8073114","kind":"LIMITATION","evidence_id":"limitation-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:series-github-series-sgl-project-sglang-e63ed0bdf0","kind":"LIMITATION","evidence_id":"limitation-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:duplicate-hint-github-series-flashinfer-7f4c25e2bf","kind":"LIMITATION","evidence_id":"limitation-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:item-arxiv-2605-24022v1-46c9a2231e","kind":"LIMITATION","evidence_id":"limitation-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:item-arxiv-2605-27081v1-5ebb44e7f0","kind":"LIMITATION","evidence_id":"limitation-1"}]},{"block_id":"claim-boundary-2","block_type":"CLAIM_BOUNDARY","text":"Claim Boundary: 原論文は研究内容を確認する一次資料だが、benchmark結果・speedup・attack success・quality比較は著者報告であり、本稿で独立再現した結果ではない。","attribution_mode":"INFERENCE","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:series-github-series-vllm-project-vllm-14c8073114","kind":"LIMITATION","evidence_id":"limitation-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:series-github-series-sgl-project-sglang-e63ed0bdf0","kind":"LIMITATION","evidence_id":"limitation-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:duplicate-hint-github-series-flashinfer-7f4c25e2bf","kind":"LIMITATION","evidence_id":"limitation-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:item-arxiv-2605-24022v1-46c9a2231e","kind":"LIMITATION","evidence_id":"limitation-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M05:item-arxiv-2605-27081v1-5ebb44e7f0","kind":"LIMITATION","evidence_id":"limitation-1"}]}],"must_cover_coverage":[{"requirement":"vLLM May release series","block_ids":["opening","theme-synthesis"]},{"requirement":"SGLang May release series","block_ids":["opening","theme-synthesis"]},{"requirement":"FlashInfer v0.6.12","block_ids":["opening","theme-synthesis"]},{"requirement":"Adaptive KV cache reuseはauthor claimとして扱う","block_ids":["opening","theme-synthesis"]},{"requirement":"ReMoEはmemory-constrained MoE inferenceのresearch complementとして扱う","block_ids":["opening","theme-synthesis"]}],"boundary_coverage":[{"requirement":"Official repository release notes verify release chronology and listed implementation changes; project performance claims and cross-hardware generalization were not independently reproduced.","block_ids":["claim-boundary-1"]},{"requirement":"The preserved original arXiv metadata/abstract is primary-paper evidence, but experimental results and generalization are author-reported and were not independently reproduced in this Evidence review.","block_ids":["claim-boundary-2"]}],"late_breaking_acknowledged":false}
